[38.97, "o", "_Understood as `command('Sanitize')`_\r\n\r\n### Sanitize: Admin command, opcode 84h [Base 2.4, 5, Figure 143, page 176, PDF page 202](https://nvmexpress.org/wp-content/uploads/NVM-Express-Base-Specification-Revision-2.4-Ratified-2026.07.31.pdf#page=202)\r\n\r\n**cdw10 [Base 2.4, 5.2.26, Figure 451, page 448, PDF page 476](https://nvmexpress.org/wp-content/uploads/NVM-Express-Base-Specification-Revision-2.4-Ratified-2026.07.31.pdf#page=476)**\r\n\r\n| Bits | Name | Acronym |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| 31:12 | Reserved |  |\r\n| 11 | Purge Required | PREQ |\r\n| 10 | Enter Media Verification State | EMVS |\r\n| 09 | No-Deallocate After Sanitize | NDAS |\r\n| 08 | Overwrite Invert Pattern Between Passes | OIPBP |\r\n| 07:04 | Overwrite Pass Count | OWPASS |\r\n| 03 | Allow Unrestricted Sanitize Exit | AUSE |\r\n| 02:00 | Sanitize Action | SANACT |\r\n\r\n**cdw11 [Base 2.4, 5.2.26, Figure 452, page 449, PDF page 477](https://nvmexpress.org/wp-content/uploads/NVM-Express-Base-Specification-Revision-2.4-Ratified-2026.07.31.pdf#page=477)**\r\n\r\n| Bits | Name | Acronym |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| 31:00 | Overwrite Pattern | OVRPAT |\r\n"]
